  "fixes": [
    "Host edits share a 1 MiB UTF-8 serialized-envelope limit, including final newline; ordinary worker delivery remains 64000 bytes.",
    "Dry-run and actual enqueue reject the same oversized normalized envelope without writing.",
    "Formal and comparator previews keep the first Lean error and bounded context alongside the output tail through a passive output observer.",
    "Passive output observation preserves process deadlines, stdin behavior, sandbox fallback, output hashes and the frozen comparator command.",
    "Host verification and advisory diagnostics use -j1 -DElab.async=false; their cache identities bind those arguments."
  ],
